-    "content": "Realized GARCH (Hansen, Huang & Shek 2012, JAE):\n\n\u4e09\u65b9\u7a0b\u5f0f\u7cfb\u7d71\uff1a\n(1) r_t = sqrt(h_t) * z_t                    (return eq)\n(2) h_t = omega + beta*h_{t-1} + gamma*x_{t-1}  (GARCH eq, x=realized measure)\n(3) x_t = xi + phi*h_t + tau(z_t) + u_t      (measurement eq)\n\n\u5176\u4e2d tau(z) = tau1*z + tau2*(z^2-1) \u662f leverage function\u3002\nx_t \u53ef\u4ee5\u662f 5-min RV\u3001bipower variation\u3001intraday range \u7b49\u3002\n\nLog-linear \u7248\u672c\uff08\u65b9\u7a0b\u5f0f 4-5\uff09\u66f4\u7a69\u5b9a\uff1a\nlog h_t = omega + beta*log(h_{t-1}) + gamma*log(x_{t-1})\nlog x_t = xi + phi*log(h_t) + tau(z_t) + u_t\n\n\u95dc\u9375\u512a\u52e2\uff1a\u7528\u65e5\u5167 RV \u66ff\u4ee3 r\u00b2 \u4f5c\u70ba\u6ce2\u52d5\u7387\u4fe1\u865f\uff0c\u4fe1\u606f\u91cf\u63d0\u5347 ~40\u500d\uff0878 \u500b 5-min bar vs 1 \u500b\u65e5\u6536\u76ca\uff09\u3002\nHansen \u9a57\u8b49\u5728 DJIA \u548c SPY \u4e0a in-sample \u548c out-of-sample \u90fd\u5927\u5e45\u6539\u5584\u3002\nQMLE \u4f30\u8a08\uff0c\u6f38\u8fd1\u6b63\u614b\u3002\n\nSource: Hansen et al. (2010/2012), https://www.eief.it/files/2010/01/peter-hansens-paper.pdf",
+    "content": "Realized GARCH (Hansen, Huang & Shek 2012, JAE):\n\n三方程式系統：\n(1) r_t = sqrt(h_t) * z_t                    (return eq)\n(2) h_t = omega + beta*h_{t-1} + gamma*x_{t-1}  (GARCH eq, x=realized measure)\n(3) x_t = xi + phi*h_t + tau(z_t) + u_t      (measurement eq)\n\n其中 tau(z) = tau1*z + tau2*(z^2-1) 是 leverage function。\nx_t 可以是 5-min RV、bipower variation、intraday range 等。\n\nLog-linear 版本（方程式 4-5）更穩定：\nlog h_t = omega + beta*log(h_{t-1}) + gamma*log(x_{t-1})\nlog x_t = xi + phi*log(h_t) + tau(z_t) + u_t\n\n關鍵優勢：用日內 RV 替代 r² 作為波動率信號，信息量提升 ~40倍（78 個 5-min bar vs 1 個日收益）。\nHansen 驗證在 DJIA 和 SPY 上 in-sample 和 out-of-sample 都大幅改善。\nQMLE 估計，漸近正態。\n\nSource: Hansen et al. (2010/2012), https://www.eief.it/files/2010/01/peter-hansens-paper.pdf",
