+    "content": "I9b: ★★★ Proper Rolling 1-Step Ahead OOS Hedge Ratio — 修正 I9 的 look-ahead 問題。\n每個 t 嚴格只用 [0,t-1] 數據估計 h_t。OOS 2020-2025 (1565 days)。\n\nSPY-ES=F (corr 0.972): Naive HE=94.4%, Best=Expanding OLS 94.5% (Δ=0.1%). DM 全 NS。h=1 足夠。\nGLD-GC=F (corr 0.924): Naive HE=84.1%, Expanding OLS 85.3% (Δ=1.2%). DM t=3.16★ Harvey PASS。OLS h≈0.86 有統計顯著改善。\nTLT-ZN=F (corr 0.804): Naive HE=45.2%, EWMA 67.8% (Δ=22.6%). DM t=6.91★★★。h≈2.3（duration mismatch），動態方法絕對必要。\n\nUtility: SPY hedge reduces utility (bull cost). TLT hedge essential (negative unhedged utility).\nGARCH 每 20 天重估（可用 M1 Max multiprocessing 改為每天）。\n\n結論與 I9 一致但更嚴格：correlation 決定是否需要動態避險。Threshold ≈ 0.95。\nScript: experiments/i9b/i9b_proper_rolling_oos_hedge.py. Results: experiments/i9b/i9b_proper_rolling_results.json.",
