-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: \u7528\u6236, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] Volume-GARCH \u5be6\u9a57\uff0c\u57fa\u65bc Lamoureux & Lastrapes (1990, JoF) MDH \u6846\u67b6\u30024 \u500b specifications: GARCH(1,1)\u3001Volume-GARCH\u3001Volume-replacing\u3001GJR+Volume\u3002detrended volume (V_t/MA252)\u3002w=2000, OOS 2023-2024\u3002\n\nH1 (persistence drop): SPY IS \u4e0b\u964d 4.03% (trajectory mean 17.56%)\uff1b0050.TW \u4e0b\u964d 92.09%\uff08volume \u5e7e\u4e4e\u53d6\u4ee3\u6574\u500b GARCH dynamics\uff09\u3002volume coefficient 100% \u6b63\u503c\u3002\n\nH2 (OOS improvement): **SPY \u5168\u90e8\u5931\u6557**\u2014\u2014\u6700\u4f73 GJR+Volume QLIKE \u50c5\u6539\u5584 0.17%\uff0cDM t=1.05 \u9060\u4f4e\u65bc Harvey 3.0\u30020050.TW \u66f4\u5dee\u2014\u2014Volume-replacing QLIKE \u60e1\u5316 895,296%\uff08\u56e0 beta\u22480 \u5931\u53bb\u6642\u5e8f\u8a18\u61b6\uff09\u3002\n\nH3 (Taiwan stronger): IS \u78ba\u8a8d\uff0892% vs 4%\uff09\u4f46 OOS \u53cd\u800c\u66f4\u5dee\u3002\u7d93\u5178 overfitting\uff1avolume \u662f\u540c\u671f\u6548\u61c9\u4e0d\u662f\u9810\u6e2c\u6027\u7684\u3002\n\n**\u6838\u5fc3\u6d1e\u898b**\uff1aL&L 1990 persistence drop \u662f contemporaneous effect\uff08Clark 1973 MDH\u2014\u2014volume \u548c vol \u540c\u6e90\u65bc info flow\uff09\uff0c\u4e0d\u662f predictive\u3002\u6628\u5929\u7684 volume \u5c0d\u660e\u5929\u7684 vol \u6c92\u6709\u8d85\u8d8a GARCH dynamics \u7684\u9810\u6e2c\u529b\u3002\u78ba\u8a8d\u4e26\u5ef6\u4f38 K113 \u7d50\u8ad6\u3002",
+    "title": "K527: ★★ Volume-GARCH (Lamoureux & Lastrapes 1990) — IS Persistence Drop but OOS NEGATIVE",
+    "content": "[提出: 用戶, 執行: Claude] Volume-GARCH 實驗，基於 Lamoureux & Lastrapes (1990, JoF) MDH 框架。4 個 specifications: GARCH(1,1)、Volume-GARCH、Volume-replacing、GJR+Volume。detrended volume (V_t/MA252)。w=2000, OOS 2023-2024。\n\nH1 (persistence drop): SPY IS 下降 4.03% (trajectory mean 17.56%)；0050.TW 下降 92.09%（volume 幾乎取代整個 GARCH dynamics）。volume coefficient 100% 正值。\n\nH2 (OOS improvement): **SPY 全部失敗**——最佳 GJR+Volume QLIKE 僅改善 0.17%，DM t=1.05 遠低於 Harvey 3.0。0050.TW 更差——Volume-replacing QLIKE 惡化 895,296%（因 beta≈0 失去時序記憶）。\n\nH3 (Taiwan stronger): IS 確認（92% vs 4%）但 OOS 反而更差。經典 overfitting：volume 是同期效應不是預測性的。\n\n**核心洞見**：L&L 1990 persistence drop 是 contemporaneous effect（Clark 1973 MDH——volume 和 vol 同源於 info flow），不是 predictive。昨天的 volume 對明天的 vol 沒有超越 GARCH dynamics 的預測力。確認並延伸 K113 結論。",
