-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] Rough volatility \u5be6\u9a57\uff08\u8df3\u8e8d\u5f0f\u63a2\u7d22\uff09\u3002Gatheral variogram \u78ba\u8a8d SPY log-vol H=0.1004 (R\u00b2=0.995)\uff0c100% \u89c0\u6e2c\u671f\u90fd\u662f 'rough' (H<0.5)\u3002\u4f46 DFA \u7d66 H=1.01\uff08long memory\uff01\uff09\u3001wavelet \u7d66 H=-0.07\u2014\u2014\u4e09\u500b estimator \u6e2c\u91cf\u4e0d\u540c\u6771\u897f\u3002\n\n5 \u500b\u6a21\u578b OOS 2023-2024 (502\u5929):\n1. HAR-Rough: QLIKE 0.3788 **\u6700\u4f73**\n2. EWMA(0.94): 0.3937\n3. RoughVol-Const: 0.4656\n4. RoughVol-TV: 0.4841\n5. GJR-GARCH: 0.6157\n\nDM test: HAR-Rough vs GJR = -7.04***\uff08\u986f\u8457\uff01\uff09\u3002\u4f46 HAR-Rough vs EWMA = -1.56\uff08\u4e0d\u986f\u8457\uff09\u3002\n\n**\u95dc\u9375\u767c\u73fe**: Time-varying H \u53cd\u800c\u66f4\u5dee (DM=+5.83 vs constant H)\u2014\u2014rolling estimation \u5f15\u5165 noise\u3002Roughness \u662f\u4e8b\u5be6 (H~0.1)\uff0c\u4f46\u5229\u7528\u5b83\u9700\u8981 multi-scale \u7d50\u69cb (HAR) \u800c\u975e pure fBm mean-reversion\u3002\n\n\u6587\u737b\u78ba\u8a8d: Gatheral et al. (2018) roughness \u5b8c\u5168\u53ef\u8907\u88fd\u3002\u4f46 Frontiers (2025) 12.3% improvement claim \u53ef\u80fd\u4f9d\u8cf4 intraday RV\uff0c\u65e5\u983b proxy \u4e0d\u8db3\u3002",
+    "title": "K529: ★★★ Rough Volatility (H=0.1) — HAR-Rough 顯著勝 GJR-GARCH (DM=-7.04) 但未勝 EWMA",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude, 執行: Claude] Rough volatility 實驗（跳躍式探索）。Gatheral variogram 確認 SPY log-vol H=0.1004 (R²=0.995)，100% 觀測期都是 'rough' (H<0.5)。但 DFA 給 H=1.01（long memory！）、wavelet 給 H=-0.07——三個 estimator 測量不同東西。\n\n5 個模型 OOS 2023-2024 (502天):\n1. HAR-Rough: QLIKE 0.3788 **最佳**\n2. EWMA(0.94): 0.3937\n3. RoughVol-Const: 0.4656\n4. RoughVol-TV: 0.4841\n5. GJR-GARCH: 0.6157\n\nDM test: HAR-Rough vs GJR = -7.04***（顯著！）。但 HAR-Rough vs EWMA = -1.56（不顯著）。\n\n**關鍵發現**: Time-varying H 反而更差 (DM=+5.83 vs constant H)——rolling estimation 引入 noise。Roughness 是事實 (H~0.1)，但利用它需要 multi-scale 結構 (HAR) 而非 pure fBm mean-reversion。\n\n文獻確認: Gatheral et al. (2018) roughness 完全可複製。但 Frontiers (2025) 12.3% improvement claim 可能依賴 intraday RV，日頻 proxy 不足。",
