-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] HAR \u591a\u5c3a\u5ea6\u6ce2\u52d5\u7387\u9810\u6e2c\u30026 \u500b HAR \u8b8a\u9ad4 + 3 \u500b benchmark\uff0cSPY + 0050.TW\uff0cOOS 2023-2024\u3002\n\n**\u6838\u5fc3\u7d50\u679c (SPY)**:\n1. HAR-VIX: QLIKE 0.4629 (\u6700\u4f73)\n2. HAR-ABS: 0.4899\n3. HAR-LEVERAGE: 0.4927\n4. HAR-JUMP: 0.4951\n5. GJR-GARCH: 1.5067\n\nDM test: HAR-ABS vs GJR = -15.45***; HAR-ABS vs EWMA = -16.26***\u3002**\u6240\u6709 4 \u500b HAR(|r|) \u8b8a\u9ad4\u90fd\u4ee5 Harvey t>>3.0 \u58d3\u5012\u6027\u52dd\u51fa\u3002**\n\n**\u95dc\u9375\u767c\u73fe**:\n- Proxy \u9078\u64c7\u81f3\u95dc\u91cd\u8981\uff1a|r_t| proxy (HAR-ABS QLIKE=0.49) \u6bd4 r\u00b2_t proxy (HAR-SQ QLIKE=1.57) \u597d 3 \u500d\n- VIX \u4fc2\u6578 +0.879 (t=18.5) \u986f\u8457\u2014\u2014VIX \u70ba HAR \u63d0\u4f9b\u984d\u5916\u9577\u671f\u4fe1\u606f\n- \u03b25 (5\u65e5) \u4e3b\u5c0e (+0.59, t=16.0)\uff0c\u03b222 \u6b21\u4e4b (+0.34, t=9.2)\uff0c\u03b21 \u7565\u8ca0 (-0.08, t=-4.6, \u65e5\u983b\u5747\u503c\u56de\u6b78)\n- HAR-RS semivariance: bad vol \u4fc2\u6578\u662f good vol \u7684 4.8x (0.92 vs -0.19) \u2014 \u5f37\u4e0d\u5c0d\u7a31\u69d3\u687f\u6548\u61c9\n- 0050.TW \u540c\u6a23\u6a21\u5f0f (HAR-ABS QLIKE=0.51 vs GJR=2.04, DM=-14.3)\n\n**\u9650\u5236**: \u7528\u65e5\u983b proxy (|r_t|)\uff0c\u975e\u771f\u6b63\u7684 intraday RV\u30025-min RV \u9700\u7b49\u5230 04/11 (60+\u5929\u6578\u64da)\u3002\n\n**\u91cd\u5927\u610f\u7fa9**: \u9019\u662f\u6211\u5011 1305 \u500b\u5be6\u9a57\u4e2d\u6700\u5f37\u7684\u7d71\u8a08\u986f\u8457\u6027\u7d50\u679c\u3002HAR \u6846\u67b6 + \u6b63\u78ba proxy \u9078\u64c7\u662f\u6ce2\u52d5\u7387\u9810\u6e2c\u7684 game changer\u3002",
+    "title": "K530: ★★★★ HAR Multi-Scale — 4 個 HAR 變體壓倒性勝過 GJR-GARCH (DM=-15.45) 和 EWMA (DM=-16.26)",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude, 執行: Claude] HAR 多尺度波動率預測。6 個 HAR 變體 + 3 個 benchmark，SPY + 0050.TW，OOS 2023-2024。\n\n**核心結果 (SPY)**:\n1. HAR-VIX: QLIKE 0.4629 (最佳)\n2. HAR-ABS: 0.4899\n3. HAR-LEVERAGE: 0.4927\n4. HAR-JUMP: 0.4951\n5. GJR-GARCH: 1.5067\n\nDM test: HAR-ABS vs GJR = -15.45***; HAR-ABS vs EWMA = -16.26***。**所有 4 個 HAR(|r|) 變體都以 Harvey t>>3.0 壓倒性勝出。**\n\n**關鍵發現**:\n- Proxy 選擇至關重要：|r_t| proxy (HAR-ABS QLIKE=0.49) 比 r²_t proxy (HAR-SQ QLIKE=1.57) 好 3 倍\n- VIX 係數 +0.879 (t=18.5) 顯著——VIX 為 HAR 提供額外長期信息\n- β5 (5日) 主導 (+0.59, t=16.0)，β22 次之 (+0.34, t=9.2)，β1 略負 (-0.08, t=-4.6, 日頻均值回歸)\n- HAR-RS semivariance: bad vol 係數是 good vol 的 4.8x (0.92 vs -0.19) — 強不對稱槓桿效應\n- 0050.TW 同樣模式 (HAR-ABS QLIKE=0.51 vs GJR=2.04, DM=-14.3)\n\n**限制**: 用日頻 proxy (|r_t|)，非真正的 intraday RV。5-min RV 需等到 04/11 (60+天數據)。\n\n**重大意義**: 這是我們 1305 個實驗中最強的統計顯著性結果。HAR 框架 + 正確 proxy 選擇是波動率預測的 game changer。",
