-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: User, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] HAR-VIX Ensemble VT Strategy\u30025 \u7a2e\u7d44\u5408\u65b9\u5f0f\u5229\u7528 HAR prediction power + VIX forward-looking nature \u7684\u4e92\u88dc\u30025 \u671f cross-OOS (2015-2024)\u3002\n\n**\u6838\u5fc3\u7d50\u679c**: 12/VIX mean Sharpe=1.593\u3002\u6700\u4f73 ensemble (HARReality) mean Sharpe=1.597 (delta +0.004)\u3002Harvey t=0.596 << 3.0\u3002\n\n\u7b56\u7565\u6392\u540d: HARReality 1.597 > 12/VIX 1.593 > DisagreeMom 1.572 > DisagreeFilter 1.554 > RegimeCond 1.479 > DynBlend 1.422\u3002\n\nBootstrap CI: HARReality vs VIX diff=+0.001 [-0.014, +0.017] P(>0)=0.500\u3002DisagreeMom diff=-0.016 [-0.086, +0.052] P(>0)=0.321\u3002\u6240\u6709 ensemble \u7b56\u7565 0/5 \u6216\u6700\u591a 2/5 win vs VIX\u3002\n\n**\u95dc\u9375\u767c\u73fe**: (1) Weight corr VIX vs HAR=0.806\uff08\u6bd4 K533 \u7684 0.506 \u66f4\u9ad8\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u7528\u4e86\u5b8c\u6574\u6a23\u672c\u800c\u975e OOS only\uff09; (2) HAR/VIX vol ratio mean=0.78\uff08HAR \u901a\u5e38\u4f4e\u4f30 vol vs VIX\uff09\u4e14 ratio>1.5 \u50c5 0.7% \u6642\u9593 \u2192 Reality Check \u5e7e\u4e4e\u4e0d\u89f8\u767c; (3) Sensitivity: \u6240\u6709\u7b56\u7565\u7684 Sharpe monotonically approach 12/VIX as parameters \u2192 VIX-only; (4) Regime: High VIX \u6642\u6240\u6709\u7b56\u7565\u90fd\u8667\uff0cHAR blend \u66f4\u5dee\uff08-2.32 vs VIX -1.86\uff09\u3002\n\n**\u7d50\u8ad6**: 12/VIX irreducible kernel \u7b2c 8 \u6b21\u78ba\u8a8d\u3002HAR \u7684 backward-looking prediction \u7121\u6cd5\u5728 economic \u5c64\u9762\u6539\u5584 VIX \u7684 forward-looking position sizing\u3002\u5373\u4f7f\u7528\u300c\u4e92\u88dc\u300d\u800c\u975e\u300c\u53d6\u4ee3\u300d\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\uff0cHAR \u4e5f\u7121\u6cd5\u63d0\u4f9b\u6709\u610f\u7fa9\u7684\u589e\u91cf alpha\u3002Prediction \u2260 application \u7b2c 6 \u6b21\u78ba\u8a8d\u3002",
+    "title": "K540: HAR-VIX Ensemble VT — 5 strategies all fail to beat 12/VIX (8th confirmation)",
+    "content": "[提出: User, 執行: Claude] HAR-VIX Ensemble VT Strategy。5 種組合方式利用 HAR prediction power + VIX forward-looking nature 的互補。5 期 cross-OOS (2015-2024)。\n\n**核心結果**: 12/VIX mean Sharpe=1.593。最佳 ensemble (HARReality) mean Sharpe=1.597 (delta +0.004)。Harvey t=0.596 << 3.0。\n\n策略排名: HARReality 1.597 > 12/VIX 1.593 > DisagreeMom 1.572 > DisagreeFilter 1.554 > RegimeCond 1.479 > DynBlend 1.422。\n\nBootstrap CI: HARReality vs VIX diff=+0.001 [-0.014, +0.017] P(>0)=0.500。DisagreeMom diff=-0.016 [-0.086, +0.052] P(>0)=0.321。所有 ensemble 策略 0/5 或最多 2/5 win vs VIX。\n\n**關鍵發現**: (1) Weight corr VIX vs HAR=0.806（比 K533 的 0.506 更高，因為用了完整樣本而非 OOS only）; (2) HAR/VIX vol ratio mean=0.78（HAR 通常低估 vol vs VIX）且 ratio>1.5 僅 0.7% 時間 → Reality Check 幾乎不觸發; (3) Sensitivity: 所有策略的 Sharpe monotonically approach 12/VIX as parameters → VIX-only; (4) Regime: High VIX 時所有策略都虧，HAR blend 更差（-2.32 vs VIX -1.86）。\n\n**結論**: 12/VIX irreducible kernel 第 8 次確認。HAR 的 backward-looking prediction 無法在 economic 層面改善 VIX 的 forward-looking position sizing。即使用「互補」而非「取代」的方式，HAR 也無法提供有意義的增量 alpha。Prediction ≠ application 第 6 次確認。",
