-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude (Paper 5 review + research_program), \u57f7\u884c: Claude] K756: \u570b\u969b VIX \u5145\u5206\u6027\u6e2c\u8a66\u300212 \u500b\u5e02\u5834\uff08SPY, EFA, EWG, EWU, EWJ, EWT, EWY, EWH, EEM, EWZ, GLD, USO\uff09\u00d7 3 \u500b\u6a21\u578b\uff08VIX-only, OwnRV-only, Combined\uff09\u30022010-2026, 4040 obs per market\u3002\n\n**\u6838\u5fc3\u767c\u73fe\uff1aVIX \u662f\u5168\u7403\u6ce2\u52d5\u7387\u9810\u6e2c\u6307\u6a19\u3002** 12/12 \u5e02\u5834 VIX \u90fd\u986f\u8457\u9810\u6e2c forward RV\uff08\u5168\u90e8\u901a\u904e Harvey t>3.0\uff09\u3002R\u00b2 \u7bc4\u570d 0.10\uff08GLD\uff09\u5230 0.35\uff08EWG\uff09\uff0cnon-US \u5e73\u5747 R\u00b2=0.236\uff08vs SPY 0.332\uff09\u3002\u6b50\u6d32\u6700\u5f37\uff08mean R\u00b2=0.324\uff09\u3001\u4e9e\u6d32\u4e2d\u7b49\uff080.212\uff09\u3001\u65b0\u8208/\u5546\u54c1\u6700\u5f31\uff080.177-0.209\uff09\u3002\n\n**VIX \u7368\u7279\u8ca2\u737b\uff08beyond own RV\uff09**\uff1a12/12 \u5e02\u5834 VIX \u90fd\u63d0\u4f9b incremental R\u00b2\uff08\u0394R\u00b2 2.4%-9.3%\uff09\uff0cpartial correlation \u5168\u90e8 Harvey \u986f\u8457\uff08t=11.3-23.4\uff09\u3002EWU\uff08UK\uff09\u0394R\u00b2=9.3% \u6700\u9ad8\uff0cEWZ\uff08Brazil\uff09\u0394R\u00b2=2.4% \u6700\u4f4e\u3002\n\n**Cross-sectional \u767c\u73fe**\uff1aUS-correlation \u9810\u6e2c VIX R\u00b2\uff08Spearman r=0.773, p=0.005\uff09\u3002\u8207\u7f8e\u570b\u5e02\u5834\u8d8a\u76f8\u95dc\u7684\u5e02\u5834\uff0cVIX \u9810\u6e2c\u529b\u8d8a\u5f37\u3002GLD \u56e0\u70ba\u8207 SPY \u5e7e\u4e4e\u4e0d\u76f8\u95dc\uff08\u03c1=0.055\uff09\uff0cVIX R\u00b2 \u6700\u4f4e\uff080.10\uff09\u3002\n\n**Region hierarchy**\uff1aEurope (0.324) > Americas (0.332) > Asia (0.212) > Emerging (0.209) > Commodity (0.177)\u3002\n\n**Paper 5 \u610f\u7fa9**\uff1a\u76f4\u63a5\u56de\u61c9 reviewer\u300cUS-specific\u300d\u8cea\u7591\u2014\u2014VIX sufficiency \u4e0d\u9650\u7f8e\u570b\u5e02\u5834\u3002data_source: yfinance (12 ETFs + ^VIX) data_period: 2010-2026 n_obs: 4040/market",
+    "title": "K756: ★★★ International VIX Sufficiency — VIX Predicts Vol for ALL 12 Global Markets",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude (Paper 5 review + research_program), 執行: Claude] K756: 國際 VIX 充分性測試。12 個市場（SPY, EFA, EWG, EWU, EWJ, EWT, EWY, EWH, EEM, EWZ, GLD, USO）× 3 個模型（VIX-only, OwnRV-only, Combined）。2010-2026, 4040 obs per market。\n\n**核心發現：VIX 是全球波動率預測指標。** 12/12 市場 VIX 都顯著預測 forward RV（全部通過 Harvey t>3.0）。R² 範圍 0.10（GLD）到 0.35（EWG），non-US 平均 R²=0.236（vs SPY 0.332）。歐洲最強（mean R²=0.324）、亞洲中等（0.212）、新興/商品最弱（0.177-0.209）。\n\n**VIX 獨特貢獻（beyond own RV）**：12/12 市場 VIX 都提供 incremental R²（ΔR² 2.4%-9.3%），partial correlation 全部 Harvey 顯著（t=11.3-23.4）。EWU（UK）ΔR²=9.3% 最高，EWZ（Brazil）ΔR²=2.4% 最低。\n\n**Cross-sectional 發現**：US-correlation 預測 VIX R²（Spearman r=0.773, p=0.005）。與美國市場越相關的市場，VIX 預測力越強。GLD 因為與 SPY 幾乎不相關（ρ=0.055），VIX R² 最低（0.10）。\n\n**Region hierarchy**：Europe (0.324) > Americas (0.332) > Asia (0.212) > Emerging (0.209) > Commodity (0.177)。\n\n**Paper 5 意義**：直接回應 reviewer「US-specific」質疑——VIX sufficiency 不限美國市場。data_source: yfinance (12 ETFs + ^VIX) data_period: 2010-2026 n_obs: 4040/market",
