-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: User, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] K803 \u6e2c\u8a66 VIX3M/VIX \u671f\u9650\u7d50\u69cb\u6bd4\u7387\u4f5c\u70ba 12/VIX \u7b56\u7565\u7684\u8986\u84cb\u4fe1\u865f\u30023 \u500b\u8b8a\u9ad4\uff1a(1) Contango Guard\uff1aVIX3M/VIX<0.95 \u6642 weight\u00d70.5\uff1b(2) Contango Smooth\uff1aweight\u00d7min(1, VIX3M/VIX)\uff1b(3) Contango Binary\uff1aVIX3M/VIX<0.90 \u6642\u73fe\u91d1 5 \u5929\u3002\u6578\u64da\uff1aSPY+^VIX+^VIX3M yfinance 2008-2026\uff0cN=4588\u3002\u5168\u671f Sharpe\uff1aBaseline=0.641, Guard=0.684, Smooth=0.649, Binary=0.703\u3002OOS(2023-2024) Sharpe\uff1aBaseline=1.194, Guard=1.206, Smooth=1.192, Binary=1.100\u3002HAC NW return-spread t-stats\uff1aGuard t=+0.48(NS), Smooth t=-0.25(NS), Binary t=+0.38(NS)\uff0c\u5168\u90e8\u4f4e\u65bc Harvey t>3.0 \u9580\u6abb\u3002Term structure \u7279\u6027\uff1abackwardation(VIX3M/VIX<1) \u4f54 10.4%\uff0cbackwardation \u65e5 SPY \u5747\u5831\u916c=-0.61%\uff08\u9ad8\u58d3\u529b\uff09\uff0ccontango \u65e5=+0.12%\u3002Binary \u7b56\u7565\u964d\u4f4e\u5168\u671f MDD \u5f9e -23.7% \u5230 -16.4%\uff0c\u4f46 OOS MDD \u53cd\u800c\u66f4\u5dee\uff08-12.9% vs -11.1%\uff09\u3002\u7d50\u8ad6\uff1aNULL RESULT\uff0c\u7b2c 4 \u6b21 VIX TS \u8986\u84cb\u5931\u6557\uff08T13\u3001N102\u3001N177 \u7686\u5931\u6557\uff09\u300212/VIX \u5df2\u96b1\u542b\u671f\u9650\u7d50\u69cb\u4fe1\u606f\uff0c\u984d\u5916\u4fe1\u865f\u4e0d\u63d0\u4f9b\u589e\u91cf\u3002",
+    "content": "[提出: User, 執行: Claude] K803 測試 VIX3M/VIX 期限結構比率作為 12/VIX 策略的覆蓋信號。3 個變體：(1) Contango Guard：VIX3M/VIX<0.95 時 weight×0.5；(2) Contango Smooth：weight×min(1, VIX3M/VIX)；(3) Contango Binary：VIX3M/VIX<0.90 時現金 5 天。數據：SPY+^VIX+^VIX3M yfinance 2008-2026，N=4588。全期 Sharpe：Baseline=0.641, Guard=0.684, Smooth=0.649, Binary=0.703。OOS(2023-2024) Sharpe：Baseline=1.194, Guard=1.206, Smooth=1.192, Binary=1.100。HAC NW return-spread t-stats：Guard t=+0.48(NS), Smooth t=-0.25(NS), Binary t=+0.38(NS)，全部低於 Harvey t>3.0 門檻。Term structure 特性：backwardation(VIX3M/VIX<1) 佔 10.4%，backwardation 日 SPY 均報酬=-0.61%（高壓力），contango 日=+0.12%。Binary 策略降低全期 MDD 從 -23.7% 到 -16.4%，但 OOS MDD 反而更差（-12.9% vs -11.1%）。結論：NULL RESULT，第 4 次 VIX TS 覆蓋失敗（T13、N102、N177 皆失敗）。12/VIX 已隱含期限結構信息，額外信號不提供增量。",
