-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: \u7528\u6236, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] K805 MEM(1,1) Comprehensive Evaluation \u2014 AMEM-r\u00b2 \u6578\u503c\u6700\u4f73\u4f46 NS vs GJR\n\nEngle & Gallo (2006) MEM \u4f5c\u70ba GARCH/HAR \u5916\u7b2c\u4e09\u8def\u7dda\u30026 \u6a21\u578b\u6bd4\u8f03\uff08SPY, OOS 2023-2024, 502 obs\uff09\u3002\n\nQLIKE on r\u00b2 \u6392\u540d\uff1a\n1. AMEM-r\u00b2: 1.4689\uff08\u975e\u5c0d\u7a31 MEM\uff09\n2. GJR-GARCH: 1.4824\n3. MEM-r\u00b2: 1.5136\n4. AMEM-|r|: 1.5159\uff08\u8f49\u63db\u5f8c\uff09\n5. GARCH(1,1): 1.5190\n6. MEM-|r|: 1.5918\uff08\u8f49\u63db\u5f8c\uff09\n\nDM Tests\uff08Harvey t>3.0\uff09\uff1a\n- AMEM-r\u00b2 vs GJR: DM=-2.19 \u2192 NS\uff08Harvey FAIL\uff09\n- AMEM-r\u00b2 vs GARCH: DM=-4.35 \u2192 AMEM WINS\uff08Harvey PASS\uff09\n- GJR vs GARCH: DM=-4.27 \u2192 GJR WINS\uff08Harvey PASS\uff09\n\n\u7d50\u8ad6\uff1a\n1. \u975e\u5c0d\u7a31\u6027\u6bd4\u6a21\u578b\u985e\u5225\u91cd\u8981\uff1aAMEM/GJR >> MEM/GARCH\uff08leverage effect \u662f\u5340\u5206\u56e0\u5b50\uff09\n2. MEM \u4e0d\u63d0\u4f9b\u8d85\u904e GJR \u7684\u7d71\u8a08\u986f\u8457\u6539\u5584\n3. \u8207 K778 \u4e00\u81f4\u4f46\u66f4\u7cbe\u78ba\uff1aAMEM \u5728 2023-2024 \u4f4e\u6ce2\u52d5\u671f\u7565\u52dd\uff0c\u4f46\u7d71\u8a08\u4e0d\u986f\u8457\n4. \u5f85 Codex \u5be9\u67e5\u78ba\u8a8d\n\n\u5be6\u9a57\u8173\u672c: experiments/k805_mem_model.py\n\u7d50\u679c\u6578\u64da: experiments/k805_mem_model_results.json\n\u6578\u64da\u4f86\u6e90: yfinance SPY (2007-2026)",
+    "content": "[提出: 用戶, 執行: Claude] K805 MEM(1,1) Comprehensive Evaluation — AMEM-r² 數值最佳但 NS vs GJR\n\nEngle & Gallo (2006) MEM 作為 GARCH/HAR 外第三路線。6 模型比較（SPY, OOS 2023-2024, 502 obs）。\n\nQLIKE on r² 排名：\n1. AMEM-r²: 1.4689（非對稱 MEM）\n2. GJR-GARCH: 1.4824\n3. MEM-r²: 1.5136\n4. AMEM-|r|: 1.5159（轉換後）\n5. GARCH(1,1): 1.5190\n6. MEM-|r|: 1.5918（轉換後）\n\nDM Tests（Harvey t>3.0）：\n- AMEM-r² vs GJR: DM=-2.19 → NS（Harvey FAIL）\n- AMEM-r² vs GARCH: DM=-4.35 → AMEM WINS（Harvey PASS）\n- GJR vs GARCH: DM=-4.27 → GJR WINS（Harvey PASS）\n\n結論：\n1. 非對稱性比模型類別重要：AMEM/GJR >> MEM/GARCH（leverage effect 是區分因子）\n2. MEM 不提供超過 GJR 的統計顯著改善\n3. 與 K778 一致但更精確：AMEM 在 2023-2024 低波動期略勝，但統計不顯著\n4. 待 Codex 審查確認\n\n實驗腳本: experiments/k805_mem_model.py\n結果數據: experiments/k805_mem_model_results.json\n數據來源: yfinance SPY (2007-2026)",
