-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: \u7528\u6236(copula-GARCH \u5c08\u9577), \u57f7\u884c: Claude] \u6e2c\u8a66 Student-t copula \u8207 Clayton copula \u80fd\u5426\u6253\u6557 K1092 DCC-A4f-ASYM \u7528\u65bc 50/50 SPY+GLD portfolio VaR/ES \u9810\u6e2c\u3002DM \u6aa2\u5b9a\uff1aH1 (Copula-t vs DCC-A4f QLIKE) t=-1.68 NS\uff1bH2 (Clayton vs DCC-A4f QLIKE) t=-1.41 NS\uff1bFZ 1% joint: t=-0.92/-0.53 \u5747 NS\u3002**NULL \u7d50\u679c**\uff1acopula \u7121\u6cd5\u986f\u8457\u6539\u5584\u3002\u6a5f\u5236\uff1aSPY-GLD \u672c\u8cea tail-independent\uff08Student-t \u03bb=0.038\uff0cClayton \u03bb_L=0.007 \u8fd1\u96f6\uff1bCOVID \u6642 \u03c1 \u8f49\u70ba -0.128 \u53cd\u5411\u79fb\u52d5\uff0c\u4e0d\u662f crash co-movement\uff09\uff0cClayton \u03b8 \u584c\u81f3\u4e0b\u9650 0.010 \u7121\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8ca0\u76f8\u4f9d\u3002Trinity: DCC-A4f-SYMM 2/2\u3001Clayton-A4f-ASYM 2/2\u3001Copula-t-A4f-ASYM 0/2\uff08MC sampling noise\uff09\u3001DCC-A4f-ASYM 1/2\uff08\u8207 K1092 \u4e00\u81f4\uff09\u3002Mean QLIKE \u6700\u4f73 DCC-A4f-ASYM (-9.11477)\u3002\u542b\u526f\u7522\u54c1\uff1aH3 Clayton vs Copula-t FZ t=+3.02 Harvey SIG\u3001DCC-GJR vs Copula-t QLIKE t=+4.08 Harvey SIG\uff08copula \u53cd\u4e0d\u5982 DCC-GARCH \u57fa\u6e96\uff09\u3002OOS 3234 \u5929 (2013-06~2026-04)\uff0cMC=5000/day\uff0cseed=42\u3002\u5c0d\u7528\u6236 PRS \u8ad6\u6587 (Lai 2024 APFM) \u7684\u555f\u793a\uff1acopula \u65b9\u6cd5\u5c0d tail-dependent pair\uff08spot-futures\uff09\u6709\u6548\uff0c\u5c0d tail-independent pair\uff08SPY-GLD\uff09DCC+A4f-ASYM \u5df2\u8db3\u5920\u3002",
+    "title": "K1100: Student-t/Clayton Copula-GARCH vs DCC-A4f-ASYM — Null Result on SPY/GLD",
+    "content": "[提出: 用戶(copula-GARCH 專長), 執行: Claude] 測試 Student-t copula 與 Clayton copula 能否打敗 K1092 DCC-A4f-ASYM 用於 50/50 SPY+GLD portfolio VaR/ES 預測。DM 檢定：H1 (Copula-t vs DCC-A4f QLIKE) t=-1.68 NS；H2 (Clayton vs DCC-A4f QLIKE) t=-1.41 NS；FZ 1% joint: t=-0.92/-0.53 均 NS。**NULL 結果**：copula 無法顯著改善。機制：SPY-GLD 本質 tail-independent（Student-t λ=0.038，Clayton λ_L=0.007 近零；COVID 時 ρ 轉為 -0.128 反向移動，不是 crash co-movement），Clayton θ 塌至下限 0.010 無法建模負相依。Trinity: DCC-A4f-SYMM 2/2、Clayton-A4f-ASYM 2/2、Copula-t-A4f-ASYM 0/2（MC sampling noise）、DCC-A4f-ASYM 1/2（與 K1092 一致）。Mean QLIKE 最佳 DCC-A4f-ASYM (-9.11477)。含副產品：H3 Clayton vs Copula-t FZ t=+3.02 Harvey SIG、DCC-GJR vs Copula-t QLIKE t=+4.08 Harvey SIG（copula 反不如 DCC-GARCH 基準）。OOS 3234 天 (2013-06~2026-04)，MC=5000/day，seed=42。對用戶 PRS 論文 (Lai 2024 APFM) 的啟示：copula 方法對 tail-dependent pair（spot-futures）有效，對 tail-independent pair（SPY-GLD）DCC+A4f-ASYM 已足夠。",
