-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: \u8cf4\u5955\u8c6a, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] \u627f\u63a5 K1067 TSMC NULL \u7684 power \u9a57\u8b49\u3002UMC T+1=2.579\uff08Top 4 \u6700\u5f37\uff09vs TSMC 0.983\uff08\u6700\u5f31\uff09\u3002\u7d50\u679c MIXED\uff1aH1 FAIL (DM t=-1.37, Harvey NS, \u65b9\u5411 EAV_better)\uff1b**H2 PASS \u6975\u986f\u8457** (\u03b8\u2082 100% 27/27 refits \u70ba\u6b63, t=+15.43, p<1e-14)\uff1b**H3 PASS** (event T+1 DM t=-2.204, p=0.036, QLIKE \u6539\u5584 +39.3%; non-event |t|=0.160)\uff1bH4 PASS (UMC +0.517% >> TSMC -0.070%)\u3002K1067 vs K1067b \u6838\u5fc3\u5c0d\u6bd4\uff1ain-sample corr \u5f9e -0.0011 \u7ffb\u81f3 +0.0319 (29x)\uff1b\u03b8\u2082 positive fraction 0.59\u21921.00\uff1b\u03b8\u2082 one-sided p \u5f9e 0.948 \u7ffb\u81f3 6.7e-15\u3002**\u7d50\u8ad6**\uff1a\u65e2\u975e\u7d14 H_vix \u4e3b\u5c0e\uff0c\u4e5f\u975e signal-absent\u3002EAV \u5728 event window \u6709\u771f\u9810\u6e2c\u50f9\u503c\u4f46 event days \u53ea\u5360 1.6%\uff0c\u7a00\u91cb\u5230\u5168 OOS \u672a\u9054 Harvey\u3002**Paper 2 \u5efa\u8b70**\uff1a\u5f9e A4f \u4e3b\u6a21\u578b regressor list \u79fb\u9664 EAV\uff0c\u4f46\u4fdd\u7559\u70ba descriptive event-window \u5206\u6790\uff08honest MIXED reporting\uff09\u3002**K1067 \u9700\u56de\u6eaf\u4fee\u6b63**\uff1a\u300cH_vix DOMINATES\u300d\u61c9\u8edf\u5316\u70ba\u300cH_vix + power insufficient\u300d\u3002Codex \u5be9\u67e5\u901a\u904e\uff0c\u65b9\u6cd5\u8ad6 100% \u5339\u914d K1067\uff08\u53ea\u6539 TICKER + H4\uff09\u3002 **[K1103 \u03c4-lag robustness verified 2026-04-13: bug effect negligible, conclusion HOLDS.]**",
+    "title": "K1067b: UMC (2303.TW) A4f-EAV — MIXED, resolves K1067 TSMC NULL",
+    "content": "[提出: 賴奕豪, 執行: Claude] 承接 K1067 TSMC NULL 的 power 驗證。UMC T+1=2.579（Top 4 最強）vs TSMC 0.983（最弱）。結果 MIXED：H1 FAIL (DM t=-1.37, Harvey NS, 方向 EAV_better)；**H2 PASS 極顯著** (θ₂ 100% 27/27 refits 為正, t=+15.43, p<1e-14)；**H3 PASS** (event T+1 DM t=-2.204, p=0.036, QLIKE 改善 +39.3%; non-event |t|=0.160)；H4 PASS (UMC +0.517% >> TSMC -0.070%)。K1067 vs K1067b 核心對比：in-sample corr 從 -0.0011 翻至 +0.0319 (29x)；θ₂ positive fraction 0.59→1.00；θ₂ one-sided p 從 0.948 翻至 6.7e-15。**結論**：既非純 H_vix 主導，也非 signal-absent。EAV 在 event window 有真預測價值但 event days 只占 1.6%，稀釋到全 OOS 未達 Harvey。**Paper 2 建議**：從 A4f 主模型 regressor list 移除 EAV，但保留為 descriptive event-window 分析（honest MIXED reporting）。**K1067 需回溯修正**：「H_vix DOMINATES」應軟化為「H_vix + power insufficient」。Codex 審查通過，方法論 100% 匹配 K1067（只改 TICKER + H4）。 **[K1103 τ-lag robustness verified 2026-04-13: bug effect negligible, conclusion HOLDS.]**",
