-    "title": "K1067c: MediaTek (2454.TW) A4f-EAV \u2014 MONOTONICITY FAIL, decisive counterexample",
-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: \u8cf4\u5955\u8c6a+Claude, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] \u7b2c\u4e09\u91cd\u9a57\u8b49\uff1aMediaTek T+1=1.67 \u4e2d\u9593\u503c\u61c9\u7d66\u4ecb\u65bc TSMC \u548c UMC \u4e4b\u9593\u7684 event DM\uff08\u9810\u671f -0.90\uff09\uff0c\u5be6\u6e2c +1.59\uff08A4f \u512a\uff09\uff0cresidual +2.49 \u8d85\u95be\u503c 5 \u500d\u3002**Monotonicity FAIL**\uff1aT+1 amplification \u4e0d\u662f EAV event-window edge \u7684\u55ae\u8abf\u9810\u6e2c\u5b50\u3002\u4e09\u516c\u53f8\u5c0d\u7167\uff1ain-sample corr -0.0011\u2192-0.0168\u2192+0.0319\uff08MediaTek \u6700\u8ca0\uff09\uff1b\u03b8\u2082 positive fraction 0.593\u21920.185\u21921.000\uff08MediaTek \u6700\u4f4e\uff0c\u975e\u4e2d\u9593\uff09\uff1bevent improvement -0.25%\u2192-23.46%\u2192+39.27%\uff08MediaTek \u5927\u5e45\u60e1\u5316\uff09\uff1bevent DM t +0.08\u2192+1.59\u2192-2.20\uff08\u65b9\u5411\u7ffb\u8f49\uff09\u3002**\u7d50\u8ad6**\uff1aUMC +39% \u53ef\u80fd\u662f firm-specific artefact\uff08foundry \u5546\u54c1\u5316\u3001\u5206\u6790\u5e2b\u8986\u84cb\u4e0d\u8db3\u3001EPS \u8b8a\u7570\u5927\uff09\uff0c\u975e\u53ef\u4e00\u822c\u5316\u898f\u5f8b\u3002**Paper 2 \u5f71\u97ff**\uff1aT+1 \u4f5c\u70ba firm-selection criterion \u4e0d\u53ef\u884c\u3002\u82e5\u4fdd\u7559 EAV\uff0c\u5fc5\u9808\u8d70 panel GARCH-MIDAS\uff08N\u226515\uff09+ \u591a firm-covariates\uff08analyst dispersion, float, foundry/fabless dummy\uff09\u3002**Codex \u767c\u73fe inherited bug**\uff1aK1067 \u7cfb\u5217 u_prev=r_{t-1}/\u221a\u03c4[t] \u61c9\u70ba \u03c4[t-1]\uff08timing mismatch\uff0cleaks forecast-day exogenous state\uff09\uff0c\u4fdd\u7559 parity \u7559\u4f5c K1103 \u7d71\u4e00\u4fee\u6b63\u2014\u2014\u82e5\u4fee\u6b63\u5f8c UMC +39% \u6d88\u5931 \u2192 \u63a8\u7ffb K1067b \u6574\u500b monotonicity \u8a0e\u8ad6\u5931\u9328\u3002 **[K1103 \u03c4-lag robustness verified 2026-04-13: bug effect negligible, conclusion HOLDS.]**",
+    "title": "K1067c: MediaTek (2454.TW) A4f-EAV — MONOTONICITY FAIL, decisive counterexample",
+    "content": "[提出: 賴奕豪+Claude, 執行: Claude] 第三重驗證：MediaTek T+1=1.67 中間值應給介於 TSMC 和 UMC 之間的 event DM（預期 -0.90），實測 +1.59（A4f 優），residual +2.49 超閾值 5 倍。**Monotonicity FAIL**：T+1 amplification 不是 EAV event-window edge 的單調預測子。三公司對照：in-sample corr -0.0011→-0.0168→+0.0319（MediaTek 最負）；θ₂ positive fraction 0.593→0.185→1.000（MediaTek 最低，非中間）；event improvement -0.25%→-23.46%→+39.27%（MediaTek 大幅惡化）；event DM t +0.08→+1.59→-2.20（方向翻轉）。**結論**：UMC +39% 可能是 firm-specific artefact（foundry 商品化、分析師覆蓋不足、EPS 變異大），非可一般化規律。**Paper 2 影響**：T+1 作為 firm-selection criterion 不可行。若保留 EAV，必須走 panel GARCH-MIDAS（N≥15）+ 多 firm-covariates（analyst dispersion, float, foundry/fabless dummy）。**Codex 發現 inherited bug**：K1067 系列 u_prev=r_{t-1}/√τ[t] 應為 τ[t-1]（timing mismatch，leaks forecast-day exogenous state），保留 parity 留作 K1103 統一修正——若修正後 UMC +39% 消失 → 推翻 K1067b 整個 monotonicity 討論失錨。 **[K1103 τ-lag robustness verified 2026-04-13: bug effect negligible, conclusion HOLDS.]**",
