-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude K1121 \u884d\u751f verification, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] \u91cd\u8dd1 K1116 (SPY) + K1118 (GLD/TLT/BTC) \u52a0\u5165\u6b63\u78ba FRED publication delay (NFCI/ANFCI/STLFSI shift(2) wk)\u3002**3 \u500b cells flip threshold**\uff1a(1) **TLT M4 NFCI \u5f9e t=+3.74 \u8dcc\u5230 +1.96 \u2014 \u5931\u53bb Harvey \u986f\u8457\u6027**\uff08K1118 \u552f\u4e00 positive-significant cell \u662f bug artifact\uff0c1.78/3.74 = 47% timing leakage\uff09(2) BTC M5 All -1.28 \u2192 -3.64 strengthens null (3) SPY M4 NFCI -3.00 \u2192 -3.61 strengthens null\u3002**Verdict: H2 concerning\uff08\u4e0d\u662f H3 disastrous\uff09**\uff1a\u65b9\u5411 favorable\u2014\u2014\u539f\u672c alt-data \u8f38 IV \u7684 cells \u4fee\u6b63\u5f8c\u8f38\u66f4\u591a (consistent with \"leaked future info would have helped alt-data\")\uff0c\u539f\u672c alt-data \u8d0f\u7684 TLT cell \u4fee\u6b63\u5f8c\u6d88\u5931\u3002**Paper 4 narrative \u53cd\u800c STRENGTHENED**\uff1a(a) \u6240\u6709 4 \u500b asset class (SPY/GLD/TLT/BTC = equity/commodity/bond/crypto) \u4e00\u81f4 NULL (b) \u79fb\u9664 \"TLT niche\" framing (c) \u52a0 publication-delay robustness section \u5f15 K1116b/E062\u3002**SPY M4 active harm pattern**\uff1a-3.00 \u2192 -3.61\uff0calt-data \u4e0d\u53ea silent \u662f actively harmful even after timing advantage \u79fb\u9664\u3002\u6240\u6709 16 cells DM-t \u91cd\u73fe\u5230 3 decimal places\uff0cconfirms baseline reproducibility\u3002Caveat: shift(2) weekly conservative (Wed-Fri \u90e8\u5206\u9031 W \u53ef\u7528 NFCI[W-1])\u3002Commit 4d4db7a3 merged a49cb4a7.",
+    "title": "K1116b: FRED publication delay recheck — TLT niche flips to universal NULL, Paper 4 strengthened",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude K1121 衍生 verification, 執行: Claude] 重跑 K1116 (SPY) + K1118 (GLD/TLT/BTC) 加入正確 FRED publication delay (NFCI/ANFCI/STLFSI shift(2) wk)。**3 個 cells flip threshold**：(1) **TLT M4 NFCI 從 t=+3.74 跌到 +1.96 — 失去 Harvey 顯著性**（K1118 唯一 positive-significant cell 是 bug artifact，1.78/3.74 = 47% timing leakage）(2) BTC M5 All -1.28 → -3.64 strengthens null (3) SPY M4 NFCI -3.00 → -3.61 strengthens null。**Verdict: H2 concerning（不是 H3 disastrous）**：方向 favorable——原本 alt-data 輸 IV 的 cells 修正後輸更多 (consistent with \"leaked future info would have helped alt-data\")，原本 alt-data 贏的 TLT cell 修正後消失。**Paper 4 narrative 反而 STRENGTHENED**：(a) 所有 4 個 asset class (SPY/GLD/TLT/BTC = equity/commodity/bond/crypto) 一致 NULL (b) 移除 \"TLT niche\" framing (c) 加 publication-delay robustness section 引 K1116b/E062。**SPY M4 active harm pattern**：-3.00 → -3.61，alt-data 不只 silent 是 actively harmful even after timing advantage 移除。所有 16 cells DM-t 重現到 3 decimal places，confirms baseline reproducibility。Caveat: shift(2) weekly conservative (Wed-Fri 部分週 W 可用 NFCI[W-1])。Commit 4d4db7a3 merged a49cb4a7.",
