-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude \u771f fresh direction \u9762\u5411 G, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] 73,203 \u500b 5-min bars (1223 trading days, 2017-2021) \u00d7 HAR-RV + OFI \u8b8a\u9ad4\u3002**Triple-threshold FAIL**: M3 |OFI| DM=-5.24 \u53cd\u5411, M4 signed +2.63, M5 persistence +5.85 best \u4f46 QLIKE only +1.12% < 5%, M6/M7 strict lag-1 t=3.50/+1.24 \u4ecd FAIL\u3002\u4f46**stylized fact \u6d6e\u73fe**\uff1a(1) **beta(|OFI|) \u8ca0\u4e14\u7a69\u5065** (M6 lag-1 t=3.50)\uff1aTAIFEX \u4e0a |OFI| \u9ad8 \u2192 \u4e0b\u4e00 5-min RV **\u4f4e**\uff0c**\u53cd US \u5e02\u5834 \"flow\u2192vol up\" \u76f4\u89ba**\u3002\u89e3\u8b80\uff1adirectional pressure \u5b8c\u6210\u5f8c vol mean-reversion (2) **\u7d50\u7b97\u65e5 |OFI| \u986f\u8457\u9ad8** (0.1194 vs 0.0991, Welch t=6.77 p<0.0001) **\u4f46 RV \u53cd\u800c\u8f03\u4f4e** (ratio 0.84x) \u2014 directional unwind \u5728 expiry close \u524d\u5b8c\u6210 (3) |OFI| ACF(1)=0.133 ACF(5)=0.120 (\u8207 Cont et al. 2014 \u4e00\u81f4). **Codex \u6514\u4e0b 2 HIGH + 1 MED bugs**: (a) DAY_END=13:45 \u5275\u9020\u865b\u5047 bar=60\uff0c\u6703\u8b93 bar 59 \u9810\u6e2c bar 60\uff0c\u6539\u6210 13:44:59 (b) Active contract \u7528\u6574\u5929\u6210\u4ea4\u91cf\u9078 = selection lookahead\uff0c\u6539\u7528 T-1 rolling (c) Current-bar OFI asymmetry\uff0c\u65b0\u589e M6/M7 strict lag-1 spec \u9a57\u8b49 beta \u4ecd\u8ca0\u7a69\u5065\u6392\u9664 current-bar leak\u3002**Paper implications**: \u4e0d\u662f\u7368\u7acb paper \u4f46\u53ef\u4f5c Taiwan microstructure \u7cfb\u5217\u4e00\u7bc0\uff0cUS \"flow\u2192vol up\" vs Taiwan \"flow\u2192vol mean-revert\" \u5c0d\u6bd4\u3002Commit ba90cc47 merged df4fce66\u3002",
+    "title": "K1124: TAIFEX OFI vol prediction NULL but discovers Taiwan stylized fact (flow→vol mean-revert)",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude 真 fresh direction 面向 G, 執行: Claude] 73,203 個 5-min bars (1223 trading days, 2017-2021) × HAR-RV + OFI 變體。**Triple-threshold FAIL**: M3 |OFI| DM=-5.24 反向, M4 signed +2.63, M5 persistence +5.85 best 但 QLIKE only +1.12% < 5%, M6/M7 strict lag-1 t=3.50/+1.24 仍 FAIL。但**stylized fact 浮現**：(1) **beta(|OFI|) 負且穩健** (M6 lag-1 t=3.50)：TAIFEX 上 |OFI| 高 → 下一 5-min RV **低**，**反 US 市場 \"flow→vol up\" 直覺**。解讀：directional pressure 完成後 vol mean-reversion (2) **結算日 |OFI| 顯著高** (0.1194 vs 0.0991, Welch t=6.77 p<0.0001) **但 RV 反而較低** (ratio 0.84x) — directional unwind 在 expiry close 前完成 (3) |OFI| ACF(1)=0.133 ACF(5)=0.120 (與 Cont et al. 2014 一致). **Codex 攔下 2 HIGH + 1 MED bugs**: (a) DAY_END=13:45 創造虛假 bar=60，會讓 bar 59 預測 bar 60，改成 13:44:59 (b) Active contract 用整天成交量選 = selection lookahead，改用 T-1 rolling (c) Current-bar OFI asymmetry，新增 M6/M7 strict lag-1 spec 驗證 beta 仍負穩健排除 current-bar leak。**Paper implications**: 不是獨立 paper 但可作 Taiwan microstructure 系列一節，US \"flow→vol up\" vs Taiwan \"flow→vol mean-revert\" 對比。Commit ba90cc47 merged df4fce66。",
