-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude K1129 \u884d\u751f, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] 4 commodity \u00d7 3 models \u00d7 4 vol proxies (r\u00b2/Parkinson/GK/RS)\u3002**H1 FAIL 0/4 triple gate under any proxy**\u3002**\u6838\u5fc3\u767c\u73fe**: range proxies \u63ed\u9732 close\u00b2 \u96b1\u85cf\u7684 damage: (1) GLD r\u00b2 DM t=-0.76 NS \u2192 range t=-4.0 to -4.1 Harvey 3 proxies \u986f\u8457 (GAS-t actively hurts) (2) USO r\u00b2 +2.65% \u2192 range all negative (noise reversal) (3) UNG range DM t=2.4-2.5 \u908a\u754c near-pass but QLIKE <5% gate (4) BTC consistent loss across 4 proxies\u3002**H2 range \u6bd4 close\u00b2 \u6548\u7387**: QLIKE magnitude \u964d 50-70%, Spearman 0.18\u21920.36-0.52\u3002**H4 Patton 2011 proxy-robustness confirmed**: model ranking \u8de8 3 range estimators identical\u3002**GAS compendium \u6700\u7d42**: K437+K1038+K1129+K1134 = 8 assets \u00d7 4 proxies = **32 DM comparisons, 0 triple-gate PASS**\u3002Paper 4 \u5347\u7d1a\u70ba 3-NULL narrative (alt-data forecasting + alt-data allocation + alt-method GAS)\u3002Codex PASS\u3002Commit 08fbbbff\u3002",
