-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] Paper 4 compendium \u64f4\u5145\u5be6\u9a57\uff1a\u6aa2\u9a57 non-score-driven robust \u6a21\u578b\uff08M3 GARCH-MIDAS-X \u4ee5 VIX \u6708\u5747\u70ba long-run driver\uff1bM4 HAR-RV-X \u52a0 VIX \u70ba daily regressor\uff1bM5 HAR-RV \u63a7\u5236\u7d44\uff09\u80fd\u5426\u5728 K1129/K1134 GAS-t \u5931\u6557\u7684 4 commodity\uff08USO/GLD/UNG/BTC-USD\uff09\u4e0a\u64ca\u6557 M1 GJR-Normal baseline\u3002OOS 2021-2026\uff08n=1323\uff09\uff0crefit_every=63\uff0cVIX \u7121 leakage\uff08daily shift(1); MIDAS \u53d6\u524d\u4e00\u5b8c\u6574\u6708 mean\uff09\u3002Fair Test #1\uff08M3 vs M1, r\u00b2 target, \u540c close\u00b2-native\uff09: 0/4 PASS, DM t=1.23/0.94/0.62/-0.32\u3002Fair Test #2\uff08M4 vs M5, Parkinson target, within HAR-family \u63a7\u5236\uff09: 0/4 PASS, DM t=1.65/-0.88/0.74/0.52\uff0cGLD \u53cd\u5411\u3002H3 CONFIRMED: \u666e\u904d robust-method NULL\uff0c\u6a6b\u8de8 score-driven \u8207 non-score-driven\u3002Paper 4 \u547d\u540d\u5f9e 'score-driven specific failure' \u5347\u7d1a\u70ba 'Universal robust-method NULL: K1129/K1134 GAS + K1136 GARCH-MIDAS-X + HAR-RV-X'\u3002\u904e\u7a0b\u4e2d\u6293\u5230 mechanical trap\uff1a\u9996\u6b21\u8dd1 M4 \u5728 Parkinson \u4e0a 4/4 t=2.5~13 \u770b\u4f3c\u7a81\u7834\uff0c\u89f8\u767c preamble Rule #5\uff08\u6548\u61c9>2x baseline = 90% bug\uff09\uff0c\u81ea\u6211\u8cea\u7591\u5f8c\u767c\u73fe\u662f model-target mismatch\uff08M4 \u4ee5 Parkinson fit\uff0c\u5929\u7136\u52dd M1 close\u00b2-fit\uff09\uff0c\u52a0\u5165 M5 within-family control \u624d\u5b64\u7acb VIX marginal value\uff0c\u7b54\u6848 NULL\u3002\u4ea6\u4fee\u4e00 VIX monthly-lag double-shift bug\u3002Codex rescue \u5be9\u904e\u4ee3\u78bc\u7121 HIGH\uff0c\u4f46\u4ecd\u9700\u7d50\u679c\u5c64\u81ea\u6211\u8cea\u7591\u3002",
+    "title": "Non-score-driven robust vol models on commodity compendium — H3 CONFIRMED universal robust-method NULL",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude, 執行: Claude] Paper 4 compendium 擴充實驗：檢驗 non-score-driven robust 模型（M3 GARCH-MIDAS-X 以 VIX 月均為 long-run driver；M4 HAR-RV-X 加 VIX 為 daily regressor；M5 HAR-RV 控制組）能否在 K1129/K1134 GAS-t 失敗的 4 commodity（USO/GLD/UNG/BTC-USD）上擊敗 M1 GJR-Normal baseline。OOS 2021-2026（n=1323），refit_every=63，VIX 無 leakage（daily shift(1); MIDAS 取前一完整月 mean）。Fair Test #1（M3 vs M1, r² target, 同 close²-native）: 0/4 PASS, DM t=1.23/0.94/0.62/-0.32。Fair Test #2（M4 vs M5, Parkinson target, within HAR-family 控制）: 0/4 PASS, DM t=1.65/-0.88/0.74/0.52，GLD 反向。H3 CONFIRMED: 普遍 robust-method NULL，橫跨 score-driven 與 non-score-driven。Paper 4 命名從 'score-driven specific failure' 升級為 'Universal robust-method NULL: K1129/K1134 GAS + K1136 GARCH-MIDAS-X + HAR-RV-X'。過程中抓到 mechanical trap：首次跑 M4 在 Parkinson 上 4/4 t=2.5~13 看似突破，觸發 preamble Rule #5（效應>2x baseline = 90% bug），自我質疑後發現是 model-target mismatch（M4 以 Parkinson fit，天然勝 M1 close²-fit），加入 M5 within-family control 才孤立 VIX marginal value，答案 NULL。亦修一 VIX monthly-lag double-shift bug。Codex rescue 審過代碼無 HIGH，但仍需結果層自我質疑。",
