-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] K1145 TW + K1147 US + K1150 JP \u4e09\u5e02\u5834 binary EAV pooled \u5168 PASS \u5f8c\u9a57\u8b49\u7b2c\u56db\u5e02\u5834 (EU DAX+CAC+FTSE)\u3002\u8cc7\u6599\u9650\u5236: 12 \u652f CAC/FTSE yfinance earnings \u904e\u7a00\u758f skip\uff0cloaded N=18 (100% quarterly, DAX-biased 56%)\u3002**\u7d50\u679c**: pooled \u03b8_EAV = +4.07e-5\uff0cbootstrap t=+4.19 PASS\uff0c95% CI [1.94e-5, 6.22e-5] \u4e0d\u542b 0\uff0cBH-FDR p=0\u3002Placebo 60 reps z=+14.77\u03c3 p=0/60 decisive\u30023 EAV-def monotonic decay (1d/3d/5d: 4.07e-5 / 1.36e-5 / 0.74e-5)\uff0cdrop-5\u00d75 seeds t=8.1-8.7 \u7a69\u5b9a\u3002**\u56db\u5e02\u5834 verdict**: direction universal (4/4 PASS + placebo p=0)\u3002\u4f46 **relative-magnitude cluster \u6253\u7834 quarterly hypothesis**: TW 0.167 / EU **0.137** / JP 0.388 / US 0.586 \u2014 EU \u662f\u7d14\u5b63\u5831\u4f46 \u03b8_rel \u843d TW cluster \u800c\u975e US+JP cluster\u3002**K1152 \u7684 quarterly-reporting-density \u89e3\u91cb REJECTED**\u3002\u65b0\u5047\u8aaa: media concentration \u00d7 analyst coverage \u5bc6\u5ea6\uff08US \u5a92\u9ad4\u5831\u5c0e\u5b63\u5831\u5bc6\u5ea6 + sell-side analyst coverage \u6700\u9ad8\uff0cDAX/EU \u5118\u7ba1\u5b63\u5831\u4f46 coverage \u5bc6\u5ea6\u8f03\u4f4e\uff09\u3002**Paper 2 narrative \u5347\u7d1a**: 'four independent equity markets, direction universal + refined two-cluster \u03b8_rel taxonomy' \u2014 Contribution 1 \u56db\u5340\u57df (America + Asia dev + Europe) direction universal \u6253\u7834\u55ae\u4e00\u5236\u5ea6\u89e3\u91cb; Contribution 2 \u5426\u5b9a quarterly cadence \u7c21\u55ae\u8aaa\u6cd5\uff0c\u958b media-concentration + analyst-coverage \u6a5f\u5236\u7814\u7a76 (\u884d\u751f K1162)\u3002Caveats: BCD converged=False (practical converged; bootstrap mean \u8cbc\u8fd1 point)\uff0cN=18 due yfinance EU earnings \u7a00\u758f\uff0c\u672a\u4f86 K1163 \u7528 BaFin/AMF/FCA \u672c\u5730 filings \u6539\u5584\u3002",
+    "title": "K1153 EU 4th market PASS — direction universal but refutes K1152 quarterly-cluster hypothesis",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude, 執行: Claude] K1145 TW + K1147 US + K1150 JP 三市場 binary EAV pooled 全 PASS 後驗證第四市場 (EU DAX+CAC+FTSE)。資料限制: 12 支 CAC/FTSE yfinance earnings 過稀疏 skip，loaded N=18 (100% quarterly, DAX-biased 56%)。**結果**: pooled θ_EAV = +4.07e-5，bootstrap t=+4.19 PASS，95% CI [1.94e-5, 6.22e-5] 不含 0，BH-FDR p=0。Placebo 60 reps z=+14.77σ p=0/60 decisive。3 EAV-def monotonic decay (1d/3d/5d: 4.07e-5 / 1.36e-5 / 0.74e-5)，drop-5×5 seeds t=8.1-8.7 穩定。**四市場 verdict**: direction universal (4/4 PASS + placebo p=0)。但 **relative-magnitude cluster 打破 quarterly hypothesis**: TW 0.167 / EU **0.137** / JP 0.388 / US 0.586 — EU 是純季報但 θ_rel 落 TW cluster 而非 US+JP cluster。**K1152 的 quarterly-reporting-density 解釋 REJECTED**。新假說: media concentration × analyst coverage 密度（US 媒體報導季報密度 + sell-side analyst coverage 最高，DAX/EU 儘管季報但 coverage 密度較低）。**Paper 2 narrative 升級**: 'four independent equity markets, direction universal + refined two-cluster θ_rel taxonomy' — Contribution 1 四區域 (America + Asia dev + Europe) direction universal 打破單一制度解釋; Contribution 2 否定 quarterly cadence 簡單說法，開 media-concentration + analyst-coverage 機制研究 (衍生 K1162)。Caveats: BCD converged=False (practical converged; bootstrap mean 貼近 point)，N=18 due yfinance EU earnings 稀疏，未來 K1163 用 BaFin/AMF/FCA 本地 filings 改善。",
