-    "content": "[\u63d0\u51fa: Claude, \u57f7\u884c: Claude] K1151 (US) + K1157 (JP) continuous EAV \u5168 NS \u5f8c\u505a mechanism control: \u5206\u9ad8\u4f4e analyst coverage sub-sample, \u6aa2\u9a57 'noise-masks-true-effect' \u5047\u8aaa\u3002Pool \u5206: yfinance numberOfAnalystOpinions median=32.5 \u2192 HIGH n=15 (MSFT/NVDA/GOOGL/META/AMZN \u7b49 33-64 analysts), LOW n=15 (BRK-B/PEP/PG/CSCO \u7b49 3-32 analysts)\u3002**\u7d50\u679c**: HIGH continuous \u03b8=+4.08e-6 boot t=+0.34 p=0.71 NS; LOW \u03b8=-6.96e-7 boot t=-0.31 p=0.73 NS\u3002Wald \u03b8_HIGH = \u03b8_LOW: t=+0.39 p=0.70 \u4e0d\u80fd\u62d2\u7d55\u76f8\u7b49\u3002HIGH \u5167\u90e8 \u0394AIC(bin-cont)=-5003 \u5f37\u70c8\u504f binary; LOW \u0394AIC=-772 \u540c\u65b9\u5411\u3002**Verdict**: BINARY-FUNDAMENTAL\u2014K1151/K1157 null \u4e0d\u662f noise artefact\uff0c\u5373\u4f7f\u9ad8 coverage \u5b50\u96c6 continuous \u4ecd\u5931\u6557\u3002Side-finding: HIGH binary boot t=+6.07 vs LOW binary t=+2.25 \u2014 binary EAV \u5728\u66f4\u53d7\u95dc\u6ce8\u80a1\u7968\u66f4\u5f37, consistent with 'attention drives announcement-day vol'\u3002**Paper 2 mechanism \u78ba\u8a8d**: information-processing friction (attention/IV crush/hedging flow) \u4e0d\u662f surprise-magnitude scale\u3002Triple-confirm \u8de8 K1151/K1157/K1162 \u4e09\u500b\u7368\u7acb test\u3002",
+    "content": "[提出: Claude, 執行: Claude] K1151 (US) + K1157 (JP) continuous EAV 全 NS 後做 mechanism control: 分高低 analyst coverage sub-sample, 檢驗 'noise-masks-true-effect' 假說。Pool 分: yfinance numberOfAnalystOpinions median=32.5 → HIGH n=15 (MSFT/NVDA/GOOGL/META/AMZN 等 33-64 analysts), LOW n=15 (BRK-B/PEP/PG/CSCO 等 3-32 analysts)。**結果**: HIGH continuous θ=+4.08e-6 boot t=+0.34 p=0.71 NS; LOW θ=-6.96e-7 boot t=-0.31 p=0.73 NS。Wald θ_HIGH = θ_LOW: t=+0.39 p=0.70 不能拒絕相等。HIGH 內部 ΔAIC(bin-cont)=-5003 強烈偏 binary; LOW ΔAIC=-772 同方向。**Verdict**: BINARY-FUNDAMENTAL—K1151/K1157 null 不是 noise artefact，即使高 coverage 子集 continuous 仍失敗。Side-finding: HIGH binary boot t=+6.07 vs LOW binary t=+2.25 — binary EAV 在更受關注股票更強, consistent with 'attention drives announcement-day vol'。**Paper 2 mechanism 確認**: information-processing friction (attention/IV crush/hedging flow) 不是 surprise-magnitude scale。Triple-confirm 跨 K1151/K1157/K1162 三個獨立 test。",
